  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>GUI Compass 是一款極簡風格且可自訂的客戶端模組，能在背包介面中使用羅盤顯示方向與座標。預設情況下羅盤位於左上角，但你可在設定檔中變更其位置與高度。<br><br>螢幕上顯示的格式可透過 'guiCompassFormat' 設定值進行修改。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>預設格式：</strong>&nbsp;<em>方向：X, Y, Z<br><br></em>你也可能對 <span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-clock\">GUI Clock</a></strong></span> 感興趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg&w=718\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的客戶端套件\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>guiCompassFormat</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"FXYZ\"<br>應在 GUI 羅盤上顯示哪些資訊。預設：[FXYZ]。F：朝向（方向），X：X 軸座標，Y：Y 軸座標（深度），Z：Z 軸座標。<br><br><span><strong>mustHaveCompassInInventory</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>&nbsp;啟用時，僅當背包中有羅盤時才會顯示 GUI 羅盤。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>compassPositionIsLeft</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於左側。<br><br><span><strong>compassPositionIsCenter</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false<br>&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於中間。<br><br><span><strong>compassPositionIsRight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false<br>&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於右側。<br><br><span><strong>compassHeightOffset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5，最小 0，最大 3000<br>&nbsp;羅盤的垂直偏移量（Y 軸座標）。這決定了座標與方向在螢幕上下移的距離。可調整以防止 GUI 重疊。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>是否為顯示的文字繪製陰影。<br><br><span><strong>RGB_R</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>&nbsp;羅盤的紅色 RGB 值。<br><br><span><strong>RGB_G</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>&nbsp;羅盤的綠色 RGB 值。<br><br><span><strong>RGB_B</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>&nbsp;羅盤的藍色 RGB 值。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>旋轉玩家時的羅盤範例：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-compass/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"292\" height=\"64\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，你可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 反馈。感謝你！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
